      "id": "judge",
      "title": "Each by its own rules",
      "plain": "The commit raises no objection, the docs push asks first since nobody pre-approved it, and the push to main is refused.",
      "technical": "judgeCommit returns null with no junk or key staged; judgePush asks for docs (no branch grant) and denies site (protected).",
